   "source": [
    "# 43. What is active learning and where is it useful?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "b4cf80d8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "What is Active Learning?\n",
    "\n",
    "Active Learning is a machine learning approach where the model selectively chooses the most informative data points and asks for their labels.\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Instead of labeling all data:\n",
    "\n",
    "Model learns from a small labeled dataset\n",
    "Then actively queries uncertain/important samples\n",
    "🎯 Core Idea\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 “Label only the data that gives maximum learning benefit.”\n",
    "\n",
    "This is useful because:\n",
    "\n",
    "Labeling data is expensive and time-consuming.\n",
    "🧠 How Active Learning Works\n",
    "Step-by-step:\n",
    "Start with small labeled dataset\n",
    "Train model\n",
    "Model identifies uncertain samples\n",
    "Human/expert labels those samples\n",
    "Retrain model\n",
    "Repeat\n",
    "📊 Common Query Strategies\n",
    "🔹 1. Uncertainty Sampling (Most Common)\n",
    "\n",
    "Select samples where model is least confident.\n",
    "\n",
    "Example:\n",
    "\n",
    "Prediction probability ≈ 0.5\n",
    "🔹 2. Query by Committee\n",
    "\n",
    "Multiple models disagree → sample selected.\n",
    "\n",
    "🔹 3. Diversity Sampling\n",
    "\n",
    "Choose diverse/unseen examples.\n",
    "\n",
    "🔹 4. Expected Model Change\n",
    "\n",
    "Pick samples that would change model most.\n",
    "\n",
    "🚀 Where is Active Learning Useful?\n",
    "🔹 1. Medical Diagnosis\n",
    "Expert labeling is costly\n",
    "Doctors label only important cases\n",
    "🔹 2. NLP Tasks\n",
    "Text classification\n",
    "Named Entity Recognition (NER)\n",
    "🔹 3. Computer Vision\n",
    "Image annotation is expensive\n",
    "🔹 4. Fraud Detection\n",
    "Analysts review suspicious transactions only\n",
    "🔹 5. Autonomous Vehicles\n",
    "Label rare driving scenarios\n",
    "✅ Benefits\n",
    "\n",
    "✔️ Reduces labeling cost\n",
    "✔️ Faster training with less labeled data\n",
    "✔️ Improves model efficiently\n",
    "\n",
    "⚠️ Limitations\n",
    "Requires human-in-the-loop\n",
    "Can be computationally expensive\n",
    "Sample selection strategy matters\n",
    "🎯 Interview-Ready Answer (Perfect)**\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 “Active learning is a machine learning approach in which the model actively selects the most informative unlabeled samples for annotation. It is especially useful in domains where labeling data is expensive, such as healthcare, NLP, computer vision, and fraud detection.”\n",
    "\n",
    "🔥 Pro Tip\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 Say this to stand out:\n",
    "\n",
    "👉 “Active learning is most valuable when unlabeled data is abundant but labeled data is scarce and costly.”"
   ]
  },
